{"seq":1,"slug":"market-structure","title":"市场结构基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/market-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"exchange-mechanics","title":"交易所运行机制与订单类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/market-structure/exchange-mechanics","wordCount":2740,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-participants","title":"市场参与者与生态系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/market-structure/market-participants","wordCount":2855,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-quality-metrics","title":"市场质量度量：流动性、波动性与效率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/market-structure/market-quality-metrics","wordCount":2866,"readingTime":12}],"introMarkdown":"# 市场结构基础\n\n本章介绍金融市场的基础结构组件。首先剖析交易所的运行机制，包括撮合引擎、订单类型和交易协议；其次分析市场参与者的角色分工，从做市商到机构投资者，理解各方的激励与行为模式；最后建立市场质量的度量框架，涵盖流动性、波动性和价格效率等核心指标。这些基础概念是理解后续价格形成、高频交易和现代市场结构的前提。\n"}